stateDiagram-v2

    [*] --> Disconnected

    Disconnected --> Discovering: Start discovery
    Discovering --> Pairing: Select Mac
    Pairing --> Connecting: Credentials accepted
    Connecting --> Connected: Session authenticated

    Connected --> ActiveTouchpad: Touchpad enabled
    ActiveTouchpad --> Connected: Touchpad disabled

    Connected --> Reconnecting: Network interruption
    ActiveTouchpad --> Reconnecting: Connection lost

    Reconnecting --> Connected: Session restored
    Reconnecting --> Disconnected: Timeout or failure

    Connected --> Disconnected: Manual disconnect
    Disconnected --> [*]

